## 2026-01-22 - Project name completion hang fix

User report: "the project name completion hangs on the new timesheet form" and "its crashed and I cannot even kill it"

Root cause: Deadlock in SearchableSelect widget
- `filterItems()` acquired mutex, then called `s.list.Refresh()` while holding it
- `list.Refresh()` triggers the list's `Length()` callback which tries to acquire the same mutex
- Result: Classic mutex deadlock causing the app to hang/freeze

Fix applied in internal/gui/widgets/searchable_select.go:
1. Modified `filterItems()` to release mutex BEFORE calling `s.list.Refresh()`
2. Modified `SetItems()` to release mutex BEFORE calling `s.list.Refresh()` 
3. Added safety check in `showPopup()` to not show empty popups

